            <note corresp="#d235-f3" n="3" xml:id="d235-f3-content">
                <p>Rusk called Senator Church at 6:52 p.m. on April 2.
                    According to a memorandum of the conversation prepared by
                        Rusk’s Personal Assistant, Carolyn J. Proctor:</p>
